meta {
  name: 06 app handoff
  seq: 7
}

docs {
  The app-handoff module is ENABLED from configuration at `auth:handoff:mount`
  (default `/app-handoff`); this repository hand-writes none of its endpoints.

  Only the session route is exercised here. The mint and redeem endpoints are NOT
  present in the consumed `AtomiCloud.Diene.AuthEngine` 1.0.0 — see
  `../withheld/app-handoff-mint-redeem.md` for the evidence and the consequence.
}
